This is a working _non released_ stoopid, stoopid, stoopid, door that just
does a CLS and prints a banner before doing a function 28, ie CLI.
Could be modified to accept passwords, etc, etc.

To compile the source, you'll need SAS C 6.X.

To install it, just use sumthin' akin to this:

  KEY  FUNCTION  EXTRAS  LOW  HIGH   PATH/FILENAME
   C      34       0     10   10000  DOORS:CLI/CLI


